### CountyPay API Testing
### Use REST Client extension in VS Code or copy to Postman

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@token = 

### ============================================
### 1. Health Check
### ============================================
GET http://localhost:5000/health

### ============================================
### 2. Register New User
### ============================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "254722222222",
  "name": "Test User",
  "password": "test123",
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

### ============================================
### 3. Login (Copy token from response)
### ============================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "254712345678",
  "password": "user123"
}

### ============================================
### 4. Login as Admin
### ============================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "254700000000",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### ============================================
### 5. Get Current User Profile
### ============================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### 6. Get All Counties
### ============================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/counties

### ============================================
### 7. Get Fees for Specific County
### Replace COUNTY_ID with actual ID from step 6
### ============================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/counties/COUNTY_ID/fees

### ============================================
### 8. Create Payment
### Replace FEE_ID with actual ID from step 7
### Replace token with actual token from step 3
### ============================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "feeId": "FEE_ID_HERE",
  "phoneNumber": "254712345678",
  "paymentMethod": "mpesa"
}

### ============================================
### 9. Get My Transactions
### ============================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/my-transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### 10. Get Transaction by ID
### Replace TRANSACTION_ID with actual ID from step 8
### ============================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/TRANSACTION_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### 11. Get Transaction by Reference
### Replace TRANSACTION_REF with actual ref from step 8
### ============================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/ref/TRANSACTION_REF
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### 12. Get Blockchain Details for Transaction
### Replace TRANSACTION_ID with actual ID from step 8
### ============================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/blockchain/transaction/TRANSACTION_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### 13. Verify Transaction on Blockchain
### Replace BLOCKCHAIN_TX_ID with actual blockchain tx ID
### ============================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/blockchain/verify/BLOCKCHAIN_TX_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### 14. Get Blockchain Explorer URL
### Replace BLOCKCHAIN_TX_ID with actual blockchain tx ID
### ============================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/blockchain/explorer/BLOCKCHAIN_TX_ID

### ============================================
### ADMIN ENDPOINTS
### ============================================

### 15. Create New County (Admin Only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/counties
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Machakos County",
  "code": "MCH"
}

### 16. Create Fee for County (Admin Only)
### Replace COUNTY_ID with actual county ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/counties/COUNTY_ID/fees
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Water Connection Fee",
  "description": "New water connection fee",
  "amount": 3000
}

### 17. Get All Transactions (Admin Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/admin/all?limit=50&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}